      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I confirmed that this problem continues to occur in the open beta of build 1605.\n\nAfter a little investigation, it appears that the transparent and invisible menu screen that opens the SteamVR Bindings Menu is covering the Launch Pad and main menu surface and interfering with the operation.\n\nThis invisible menu seems to always follow and interfere with the Launch Pad if it is the Launch Pad, and if it is the Main Menu, it appears in front of the expanded Main Menu and seems to be fixed in place, interfering with it. (When the main menu is expanded and the main menu is shifted from the front to the side by Grab, the main menu can be operated relatively normally.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
