  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Click on Launch Drone button\n\n2. Promt comes up telling no binds set\n\n3. Click on set binds\n\n-->4. After that no matter where you click on the quick menu it will always open the SteamVR Bindings menu.\n\n5.Restarting game fixes it.\n\nVideo:",
